# Jian (slot 0) and Gabryel (slot 1) in the party, in the first Delrich Temple battle, for the skill
# plans. Both have their HP pinned to 999; their other stats are as the save has them (level 1). Field
# records are 0x5C each from 0x020B4658: Jian's HP at 0x020B4668 / 0x020B466C; Gabryel's record is at
# 0x020B4710 (level index 0x020B471C, HP 0x020B4720 / 0x020B4724). Battlers and stat records 0 and 1 are
# theirs. Built like party_rufus.plan.
include boot_from_save
pin u16 0x020B466C 999
pin u16 0x020B4668 999
pin u16 0x020B4724 999
pin u16 0x020B4720 999
pin u16 0x020B464C 0
pin u16 0x020B4650 2
pin u16 0x020B4654 65535
include warp6
pin u16 0x020B466C 999
pin u16 0x020B4668 999
pin u16 0x020B4724 999
pin u16 0x020B4720 999
pin u16 0x020B464C 0
pin u16 0x020B4650 2
pin u16 0x020B4654 65535
